WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Choose the page from the sidebar
From the sidebar choose “Settings & channels”, then open the “Developers” tab.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Open Developers
From Settings & channels open the Developers tab.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Review the documentation
Review the integration tools, the documentation and the endpoints shown before setting up your external system.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Test the connection
Test with sample data and check the results; do not share connection keys in messages or recordings.
